{"id":"word:hebrew:H6763","type":"word","title":"צֵלָע","subtitle":"H6763 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a rib (as curved), literally (of the body) or figuratively (of a door, i.e. leaf); hence, a side , literally (of a person) or figuratively (of an object or the sky, i.e. quarter); architecturally, a (especially floor or ceiling) timber or plank (single or collective, i.e. a flooring)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to צֵלָע (H6763) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 41 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"צֵלָע (tsêlâʻ) means a rib (as curved), literally (of the body) or figuratively (of a door, i.e. leaf); hence, a side , literally (of a person) or figuratively (of an object or the sky, i.e. quarter); architecturally, a (especially floor or ceiling) timber or plank (single or collective, i.e. a flooring) First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 6 5."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"צֵלָע","transliteration":"tsêlâʻ","pronunciation":"tsay-law'","strong":"H6763","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6763","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["צֶֽלַע","צַלְעֹ֣ת","צְלָע֖וֹת","הַ/צֵּלָע֙","בְּ/צַלְע֣וֹת"],"morphs":[["HNcbsc",7],["HTd/Ncbsa",4],["HNcbsc/Sp3ms",4],["HNcbpc",4],["HNcbpa",3],["HR/Ncbpc",3],["HTd/Ncbpa",2],["HC/R/Ncbsc",2],["HNcbpc/Sp3ms",2],["HNcbsa",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"a rib (as curved), literally (of the body) or figuratively (of a door, i.e. leaf); hence, a side , literally (of a person) or figuratively (of an object or the sky, i.e. quarter); architecturally, a (especially floor or ceiling) timber or plank (single or collective, i.e. a flooring)","usage":"beam, board, chamber, corner, leaf, plank, rib, side (chamber).","full":"H6763. tsela צֵלָע 41 noun feminine ( masculine 1Kin 6:34 , and apparently Exod 26:26 ) rib, side ; — absolute ׳צ Gen 2:22 +, construct צֶ֫לַע Exod 26:26 +, also צֵ֫לַע 2Sam 16:13 ; suffix צַלְעוֺ Exod 25:12 +; plural צְלָעִים 1Kin 6:34 , צְלָעוֺת 6:3 +; construct צַלְעֹת Ezek 41:26 +; suffix צַלְעֹתָיו Gen 2:21 +; — 1 rib of man Gen 2:21-22 , (J). 2 rib of hill, i.e. ridge, or terrace 2Sam 16:13 . 3 side-chambers or cells (enclosing temple like ribs) 1Kin 6:5-6 , (read ׳הַצּ for היצוע , see [ יָצִיעַ ]), 7:3 , so of Ezekiel's temple Ezek 41:5 10 t. 41 (on text see Co Toy Krae). 4 ribs of cedar and fir, i.e. planks, boards (plural), of temple wall 1Kin 6:15-16 , floor 6:15 . 5 leaves of door 1Kin 6:34 . 6 (in P) side , of ark ( אֶרוֺן ) Exod 25:12 (twice in verse); 25:14 = 37:3 (twice in verse); 37:5 ; of tabernacle ( מִשְׁכָּן ) 26:20 (|| מֵּאָה 26:18 ), 26:26 ; 26:27 ; 26:27 = 36:25 (|| ׳פ 36:23 ), 36:31 ; 36:32 , 26:35 (twice in verse); of altar 27:7 = 38:7 , 30:4 = 37:27 . &#8212; Jer 20:10 ; Job 18:12 see צֶלַע below II. צלע .","rootNote":"or (feminine) צַלְעָה ; from 6760 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 6 5","keyReferences":["1Kgs 6 5","1Kgs 6 8","1Kgs 6 15","1Kgs 6 15","1Kgs 6 16","1Kgs 6 34","1Kgs 7 3","2Sam 16 13"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":41,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 6 5","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"צְלָע֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 8","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/צֵּלָע֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 15","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/צַלְע֣וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncbpc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 15","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/צַלְע֥וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncbpc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 16","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/צַלְע֣וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncbpc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 34","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":3